EMITTER REFUSED: typed C entry emit: board `zephyr` has no C-ABI `run_components` — the C board surface is native-only, so this emitter would name `nros_board_native_*` on a target that does not have it. An embedded C entry is rendered by the C++ pack (which drives the C++ board runner and calls each C node through its `extern "C"` seam); that routing is what `nros codegen entry-pack --lang c --board zephyr` reports. phase-432 W3.1 is the item that would give this board a C runner.
